 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>You have perfected the basics of manipulating cursed energy, causing your effectiveness and efficiency to explode.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Cursed Strike</strong>. On a hit, you can spend up to your proficiency bonus, dealing an additional 1d12 necrotic damage per CE spent.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Cursed Reinforcement</strong>. As an action, bonus action, or reaction you can spend up to your Cursed Energy modifier + proficiency to reinforce your body. You gain 5 temporary hit points per CE.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Efficiency</strong>. When using a cursed technique, the base cost decreases by 1 (min cost of 1).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
